", "title": "DyPE设置说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [481.86614990234375, 328.1129150390625], "pos": [-1444.689208984375, 332.1808166503906], "id": 49, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["## 消除白噪声\n\n* 要消除白斑噪声，请使用 LoRA。 [DeJPEG-LoRA](https://huggingface.co/wcde/Z-Image-Turbo-DeJPEG-Lora) 效果很好。它还可以改善比例。\n\n* 增加 dype_exponent 可以减少这种噪音，但可能会扭曲比例。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Better quality", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [481.10980224609375, 207.25733947753906], "pos": [-1443.5706787109375, 711.386962890625], "id": 52, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [50], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Chinese fairy in misty bamboo forest, ethereal beauty, flowing silk hanfu, delicate features, serene expression, soft cinematic lighting, by Studio Ghibli and Artgerm, highly detailed, 8k, best quality\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "title": "输入提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [350.95220947265625, 384.139892578125], "pos": [-923.717041015625, 375.8189392089844], "id": 53, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.33.10", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [815.3112360823062, -169.95293360806113], "scale": 1.061076460